{"content_hash": "f77f2a115865cdb9", "version_id": 864, "article_id": 87, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Hitcard eyes backdoor listing with stake in solar glass maker", "title_zh": "Hitcard拟收购亚玛顿20%股份，疑似借壳上市", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8192045.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589759829060-eb3e3a77cdee?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8aGl0Y2FyZHxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzNzU2MTA1fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Fearghal Kelly on Unsplash", "author": "Fearghal Kelly", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@fgal?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-5OgIsvOO1Rk?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(21, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(59, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "f08d1f69b25e"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-04", "word_count": 271, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "A trading card company backed by Pop Mart and Sequoia China has agreed to buy a 20% stake in solar glass maker Almaden, a deal that could give it a faster route to the stock market.", "lead_zh": "一家获得泡泡玛特和红杉中国投资的卡牌公司，已同意收购光伏玻璃企业亚玛顿20%的股份，这笔交易可能让它更快登陆资本市场。", "preview": "Almaden (002623.SZ) said on the evening of November 2 that its controlling shareholder plans to sell 20% of the company to Shanghai Qixing N", "preview_zh": "亚玛顿（002623.SZ）11月2日晚间公告称，控股股东拟将公司20%股份转让给运营潮玩卡牌品牌Hitcard的上海骑形网络。若交易完成，上市公司控股股东及实际控制人将发生变更。双方已签署意向协议，价格尚未确定，公司股票自11月3日起停牌。此前一个交易日，股价以涨停价19.28", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 847, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 113.15, "size_bytes": 679824, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 311, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 115.325, "size_bytes": 692928, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 311, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 123.6, "size_bytes": 742608, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 311, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 107.45, "size_bytes": 645696, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 311, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 115.125, "size_bytes": 691776, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 311, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@0cb59f2/content/data/versions/864.json", "paragraphs": ["Almaden (002623.SZ) said on the evening of November 2 that its controlling shareholder plans to sell 20% of the company to Shanghai Qixing Network, which runs the collectible card brand Hitcard. If the deal closes, the listed company's controlling shareholder and actual controller will change. The two sides have signed a letter of intent, the price is not yet fixed, and trading was suspended from November 3. The stock had closed at its daily limit of 19.28 yuan the day before.", "Hitcard has long wanted to go public, but the path has been slow. Rival card makers Kayou and Suplay have both seen Hong Kong listing applications lapse without a launch. The announcement requires the buyer to check whether Almaden can legally issue shares to buy assets or carry out a major restructuring, and Hitcard can walk away with its 50 million yuan deposit if it cannot. That condition points clearly to a backdoor listing.", "The seller is under pressure. Almaden processes solar glass, and that business brought in 84.46% of revenue in 2025. As the solar industry slumped, revenue fell from 3.63 billion yuan in 2023 to 2.04 billion yuan in 2025, and the company posted losses in both 2024 and 2025. Two attempts to buy upstream supplier Fengyang Silicon Valley, in 2022 and 2024, both ended in failure.", "The Lin family, which controls Almaden, will keep 14.90% after the sale, down from 34.90%. That leaves the buyer with only a small lead, since family holdings add up to roughly 17.76%. The family has already collected about 94.33 million yuan in dividends, though 40 million of its shares are pledged."], "paragraphs_zh": ["亚玛顿（002623.SZ）11月2日晚间公告称，控股股东拟将公司20%股份转让给运营潮玩卡牌品牌Hitcard的上海骑形网络。若交易完成，上市公司控股股东及实际控制人将发生变更。双方已签署意向协议，价格尚未确定，公司股票自11月3日起停牌。此前一个交易日，股价以涨停价19.28元收盘。", "Hitcard一直希望上市，但进展缓慢。同行卡游和Suplay的港股上市申请均因到期失效而未能启动发行。公告要求买方核查亚玛顿是否具备发行股份购买资产或重大资产重组的法定条件，若不具备，Hitcard可终止协议并收回5000万元保证金。这一条款明显指向借壳上市。", "卖方压力不小。亚玛顿主营光伏玻璃深加工，2025年该业务贡献了84.46%的营收。随着光伏行业下行，营收从2023年的36.28亿元降至2025年的20.36亿元，2024年和2025年连续亏损。公司2022年和2024年两次尝试收购上游供应商凤阳硅谷，均以失败告终。", "控股亚玛顿的林氏家族在交易后将保留14.90%股份，低于此前的34.90%。买方领先优势并不明显，因为家族合计持股粗算约17.76%。林氏此前已获得约9433万元分红，但仍有4000万股处于质押状态。投资者接下来将关注Hitcard的卡牌资产是否注入，以及光伏玻璃业务将如何处置。"], "body": "Almaden (002623.SZ) said on the evening of November 2 that its controlling shareholder plans to sell 20% of the company to Shanghai Qixing Network, which runs the collectible card brand Hitcard. If the deal closes, the listed company's controlling shareholder and actual controller will change. The two sides have signed a letter of intent, the price is not yet fixed, and trading was suspended from November 3. The stock had closed at its daily limit of 19.28 yuan the day before.\n\nHitcard has long wanted to go public, but the path has been slow. Rival card makers Kayou and Suplay have both seen Hong Kong listing applications lapse without a launch. The announcement requires the buyer to check whether Almaden can legally issue shares to buy assets or carry out a major restructuring, and Hitcard can walk away with its 50 million yuan deposit if it cannot. That condition points clearly to a backdoor listing.\n\nThe seller is under pressure. Almaden processes solar glass, and that business brought in 84.46% of revenue in 2025. As the solar industry slumped, revenue fell from 3.63 billion yuan in 2023 to 2.04 billion yuan in 2025, and the company posted losses in both 2024 and 2025. Two attempts to buy upstream supplier Fengyang Silicon Valley, in 2022 and 2024, both ended in failure.\n\nThe Lin family, which controls Almaden, will keep 14.90% after the sale, down from 34.90%. That leaves the buyer with only a small lead, since family holdings add up to roughly 17.76%. The family has already collected about 94.33 million yuan in dividends, though 40 million of its shares are pledged.", "body_zh": "亚玛顿（002623.SZ）11月2日晚间公告称，控股股东拟将公司20%股份转让给运营潮玩卡牌品牌Hitcard的上海骑形网络。若交易完成，上市公司控股股东及实际控制人将发生变更。双方已签署意向协议，价格尚未确定，公司股票自11月3日起停牌。此前一个交易日，股价以涨停价19.28元收盘。\n\nHitcard一直希望上市，但进展缓慢。同行卡游和Suplay的港股上市申请均因到期失效而未能启动发行。公告要求买方核查亚玛顿是否具备发行股份购买资产或重大资产重组的法定条件，若不具备，Hitcard可终止协议并收回5000万元保证金。这一条款明显指向借壳上市。\n\n卖方压力不小。亚玛顿主营光伏玻璃深加工，2025年该业务贡献了84.46%的营收。随着光伏行业下行，营收从2023年的36.28亿元降至2025年的20.36亿元，2024年和2025年连续亏损。公司2022年和2024年两次尝试收购上游供应商凤阳硅谷，均以失败告终。\n\n控股亚玛顿的林氏家族在交易后将保留14.90%股份，低于此前的34.90%。买方领先优势并不明显，因为家族合计持股粗算约17.76%。林氏此前已获得约9433万元分红，但仍有4000万股处于质押状态。投资者接下来将关注Hitcard的卡牌资产是否注入，以及光伏玻璃业务将如何处置。", "text": "Almaden (002623.SZ) said on the evening of November 2 that its controlling shareholder plans to sell 20% of the company to Shanghai Qixing Network, which runs the collectible card brand Hitcard. If the deal closes, the listed company's controlling shareholder and actual controller will change. The two sides have signed a letter of intent, the price is not yet fixed, and trading was suspended from November 3. The stock had closed at its daily limit of 19.28 yuan the day before. Hitcard has long wanted to go public, but the path has been slow. Rival card makers Kayou and Suplay have both seen Hong Kong listing applications lapse without a launch. The announcement requires the buyer to check whether Almaden can legally issue shares to buy assets or carry out a major restructuring, and Hitcard can walk away with its 50 million yuan deposit if it cannot. That condition points clearly to a backdoor listing. The seller is under pressure. Almaden processes solar glass, and that business brought in 84.46% of revenue in 2025. As the solar industry slumped, revenue fell from 3.63 billion yuan in 2023 to 2.04 billion yuan in 2025, and the company posted losses in both 2024 and 2025. Two attempts to buy upstream supplier Fengyang Silicon Valley, in 2022 and 2024, both ended in failure. The Lin family, which controls Almaden, will keep 14.90% after the sale, down from 34.90%. That leaves the buyer with only a small lead, since family holdings add up to roughly 17.76%. The family has already collected about 94.33 million yuan in dividends, though 40 million of its shares are pledged.", "vocab": [{"word": "controlling shareholder", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "控股股东", "note": "公司治理常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "letter of intent", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "意向协议", "note": "正式合同前的初步文件", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "suspend trading", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "停牌", "note": "股市用语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "backdoor listing", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "借壳上市", "note": "通过收购上市公司实现上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lapse", "pos": "verb", "zh": "（申请）失效", "note": "常指申请到期未推进", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "restructuring", "pos": "noun", "zh": "重组", "note": "企业资产或业务调整", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deposit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "保证金", "note": "交易中的担保款项", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "营收", "note": "公司经营收入", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "slump", "pos": "verb", "zh": "大幅下滑", "note": "形容行业或业绩下跌", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "upstream", "pos": "adj", "zh": "上游的", "note": "供应链前端环节", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pledge", "pos": "verb", "zh": "质押", "note": "股份质押融资", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inject assets", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "注入资产", "note": "借壳上市中的关键步骤", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-04T01:35:03.845173", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Almaden", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.85, "sm": 300, "em": 850, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "(", "s": 0.85, "e": 0.925, "sm": 850, "em": 924, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "002623", "s": 0.925, "e": 2.325, "sm": 925, "em": 2324, "cs": 9, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ".", "s": 2.325, "e": 2.558, "sm": 2324, "em": 2558, "cs": 15, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "SZ", "s": 2.558, "e": 3.025, "sm": 2558, "em": 3024, "cs": 16, "ce": 18, "si": 1}, {"i": 5, "w": ")", "s": 3.025, "e": 3.288, "sm": 3025, "em": 3287, "cs": 18, "ce": 19, "si": 1}, {"i": 6, "w": "said", "s": 3.288, "e": 3.487, "sm": 3287, "em": 3487, "cs": 20, "ce": 24, "si": 1}, {"i": 7, "w": "on", "s": 3.487, "e": 3.587, "sm": 3487, "em": 3587, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 1}, {"i": 8, "w": "the", "s": 3.587, "e": 3.712, "sm": 3587, "em": 3712, "cs": 28, "ce": 31, "si": 1}, {"i": 9, "w": "evening", "s": 3.712, "e": 4.088, "sm": 3712, "em": 4087, "cs": 32, "ce": 39, "si": 1}, {"i": 10, "w": "of", "s": 4.088, "e": 4.162, "sm": 4087, "em": 4162, "cs": 40, "ce": 42, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "November", "s": 4.162, "e": 4.562, "sm": 4162, "em": 4562, "cs": 43, "ce": 51, "si": 1}, {"i": 12, "w": "2", "s": 4.562, "e": 5.013, "sm": 4562, "em": 5012, "cs": 52, "ce": 53, "si": 1}, {"i": 13, "w": "that", "s": 5.013, "e": 5.162, "sm": 5012, "em": 